    "ix.31": "No logins, no accounts — every page runs in the browser. Student writing and products live on paper or in tools your district already vets.",
    "ix.32": "⚠️ <b>Honest history:</b> this unit teaches the 1903 secession of Panama from Colombia, the “in perpetuity” Canal Zone concession, and the human cost of construction — including the segregated “gold roll / silver roll” labor system — directly, factually, and respectfully (TEC §28.0022). It also notes the 1977 Torrijos–Carter Treaties that returned the canal to Panama by 1999.",
    "ix.33": "▶ Start Phase 1 — Surface",
    "ix.34": "🧑‍🏫 Facilitator guide",
